  names:
  - You
  - Handler
  - You
  - Handler
  - You
  - Handler
  - You
  - Handler
  - You
  lines:
  - I took the shot. Mission complete, right?
  - Yes, our scout in the field says you got the right target. Good job.
  - "Wait\u2026 since when did we have a scout here?"
  - "Well, how else would we confirm that you did your job right? You\u2019re still
    just an apprentice."
  - "You\u2019re telling me the SCOUT could\u2019ve described the target to me this
    whole time!?"
  - "Oh, did you have a PROBLEM with my instructions, you little whelp? If that\u2019s
    the case I may need to EXTEND your apprenticeship\u2026"
  - No sir!
  - Now leave the area, quick! Leave no trace of your presence.
  - Yes sir!
  textSpeed: 0.1
  yes: {fileID: 986162422}
  panel: {fileID: 986162422}
  Directions: 0
